# Postcode graph artefacts and source data — NEVER commit these.
#
# ONSPD's Northern Ireland (BT) records are licensed from Land & Property
# Services for internal use only and may not be redistributed, so committing a
# copy would be a licensing breach, not just a large file. The patterns match by
# name as well as by directory, so a copy made outside data/ is still caught.
/data/
*.ppg

# ONS postcode products, any extension, anywhere.
ONSPD*
NSPL*
*_UK.csv
*_UK.txt

# Census population extracts used to build the prior.
census*_oa_population*.csv
*usualresidentpopulation*.csv
ni_census*
*census-2021*
